        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "MTV SPORTS: T.J. Lavin's Ultimate BMX puts the action of riding a stunt BMX bike in the palm of your hand. The game offers six different professional riders: T.J. Lavin, Fuzzy Hall, Chris Duncan, Mike Ardelean, Jamie Bestwick, or Colin Winkelmann. Try to pull off the most spectacular stunts in three different play modes: Vert, Street, and Dirt. Vert has the player performing tricks on a halfpipe; Street has the player navigate a course with ramps, fun boxes, and other objects while executing tricks to win the judges attention; and the Dirt event puts the player on a dirt track to try to pull off big tricks without biting the dust. Master the skills of professional BMX in MTV SPORTS: T.J. Lavin's Ultimate BMX.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
